  triage:description "quality-mgr BB2-QA3-1789251000 (Final verdict FAIL, https://github.com/randlee/atm-core/pull/1447#issuecomment-5648745882, 2026-09-12T21:17:10Z; BB2-QA3-I3), reviewed at d2a9b6cc5. CLAUDE.md:108 ('Sprint Execution Pattern' step 4): 'Retry loop if QA fails (max attempts configurable)' contradicts the append-only-stack model documented 24 lines later in the same file (CLAUDE.md:136+, pointing to docs/development/gh-stack-guidelines.md section 0/9 'Freeze means freeze' -- QA-fail findings go to a new top-of-stack fix layer, never a same-branch retry). Confirmed via direct read." ;
